    {
      "name": "Project panel",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "project-panel",
      "description": "A flat bordered frame with project metadata, title, and contribution.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-project\"><h3>Group Think</h3><p class=\"ds-project-meta\">iOS / June 2026 to present</p><p class=\"ds-project-copy\">A collaborative iOS app for shared study halls and group screen time limits.</p><p class=\"ds-project-role\"><strong>My role</strong> UI and frontend, Firebase integration, and backend contributions.</p></article>",
      "css": ".ds-project{font-family:var(--font,Manrope,system-ui,sans-serif);max-width:560px;padding:40px;border:1px solid var(--line,#313131);border-radius:12px;background:var(--surface,#181818);color:var(--text,#f3f3ee);overflow:hidden}.ds-project p,.ds-project h3{margin:0}.ds-project-meta{font-size:12px;line-height:16px;color:var(--muted,#b0b0a8)}.ds-project h3{margin-top:16px;font-size:30px;line-height:36px;letter-spacing:-.03em;font-weight:600}.ds-project-copy{margin-top:16px!important;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:var(--muted,#b0b0a8)}.ds-project-role{margin-top:16px!important;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:var(--muted,#b0b0a8)}.ds-project-role strong{margin-right:8px;color:var(--text,#f3f3ee);font-weight:600}@media(max-width:800px){.ds-project h3{font-size:24px;line-height:32px}}@media(max-width:600px){.ds-project{padding:24px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Native project disclosure",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "project-details",
      "description": "Native expandable technical detail with a sage plus/minus symbol.",
      "html": "<details class=\"ds-details\"><summary>Inside the build<span class=\"ds-details-symbol\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><div class=\"ds-details-body\"><p>SwiftUI provides the native interface, while Firebase supports sign in and realtime state synchronization across devices.</p><h4>Keeping session totals current</h4><p>A live profile listener lets the summary react as updated Firestore data arrives, with cleanup when the listener ends.</p></div></details>",
      "css": ".ds-details{font-family:var(--font,Manrope,system-ui,sans-serif);max-width:520px;color:var(--text,#f3f3ee)}.ds-details summary{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;min-height:48px;list-style:none;cursor:pointer;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;font-weight:600}.ds-details summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}.ds-details-symbol{position:relative;width:16px;height:16px;flex:none;color:var(--accent,#b7c5a3)}.ds-details-symbol::before,.ds-details-symbol::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;background:currentColor;top:7px;left:2px;width:12px;height:1px;transition:transform 180ms var(--ease,cubic-bezier(.32,.72,0,1))}.ds-details-symbol::after{transform:rotate(90deg)}.ds-details[open] .ds-details-symbol::after{transform:rotate(0)}.ds-details-body{padding-top:8px;color:var(--muted,#b0b0a8);font-size:14px;line-height:20px}.ds-details-body p{margin:0}@media(hover:hover) and (pointer:fine){.ds-details summary:hover{color:var(--accent,#b7c5a3)}}.ds-details summary:active{color:var(--accent,#b7c5a3)}.ds-details summary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent,#b7c5a3);outline-offset:4px;border-radius:4px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-details-symbol::before,.ds-details-symbol::after{transition:none}}.ds-details-body h4{margin:24px 0 8px;color:var(--text,#f3f3ee);font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600}"
    },
